      "content": "Interesting ranking. I'm curious about your reasoning for putting Marcus first. \"High-energy\" and \"direct communication\" can sometimes be interpreted as being too aggressive for certain conservative boardrooms. On the flip side, you mentioned James might be less \"relatable\" due to his networking circles, but wouldn't that traditional background actually be a strength for \"gravitas\" in these specific circles? \n\nCan you dive a bit deeper into the specific personality traits or \"vibes\" each candidate projects to you? I'm trying to understand if there are any subtle gaps in how they might be perceived by a traditional, old-school CEO.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
